<title>DENMARK: IBRD issues 500 mln DKK 8-YR 4 pct bond - Sydbank.</title>
<headline>IBRD issues 500 mln DKK 8-YR 4 pct bond - Sydbank.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPENHAGEN, Nov 1 Reuter - The following issue was announced on Friday by co-lead Sydbank.</p>
<p>BORROWER - INTERNATIONAL BANK FOR RECONSTRUCTION AND DEVELOPMENT.</p>
<p>AMT- 500 MLN DKK  COUPON-4.0 PCT  MATURITY - 18 NOVEMBER 2004</p>
<p>TYPE - STRAIGHT   ISS PRICE - TO BE ADVISED  PAY DATE - 4 NOV. 1996</p>
<p>-- Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33 969650</p>
</text>
